+ row  WAV  `Wave`  `audio/x-wav`
+ row  AIFF  `Aiff`  `audio/x-aiff`
+ row  AIFC  `Aifc`  `audio/x-aifc`
+ row  AU  `Au`  `audio/basic`
+ row  SND  `Snd`  `audio/basic`

% 1 1 0 1430d9a56718b4641d7f82f25a6257b5

